07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VS2HbfuvE6cQ7kNvwHn4UUA&_nc_oc=Adq150nFJiX1P36oAHPE5l80rqT9vh3rYFBqlBt2_yi797jqmRjsqfjBc_dGQmT9isI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIp32NEjn7PUMFRnaMqIOx1oDTU2MzeFIBDyfWBYp-a1Q&oe=6AAAA542"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6PQnOSks2qIQ7kNvwG5dKv4&_nc_oc=AdqmaYHUTEPvLVKEKpHx9_OPOPJ4urpRZFE00r7ZAy-rOoKsue0mxmdaQpgffaOcA8c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKdr_4yV__Ki29_ju4uHfMxxYjziaKacOTyBcuImPpXuw&oe=6AAA9ABF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U2S48Ow459cQ7kNvwHNImpg&_nc_oc=AdohMcmnOZ9EJAMuG4W6D8KUKbbuqt1heOCWN3yB6iNu7xv66jFgYIpYvFiiIHMsmO4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJyXqO5xn3DPt_kNTPB9wwdHdoMfV6KQLq63nvTSu07LA&oe=6AAAA9B0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic